    "q-19307": {
      "dom_id": "step-q19307",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "Given the following piecewise function $f(x),$ what is $f(1)?$\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}2x+7,\\, & x\\le 1 \\\\ 2x-3,\\, & x>1\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "Since $x=1$ is in the interval $x\\le 1,$ we use the left-hand branch, namely $f(x)=2x+7:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(1) & =2(1)+7 \\\\  & =2+7 \\\\  & =9\\end{aligned}\n$$",
